<description>&lt;p&gt;Fighting between Myanmar rebels and the army continues to spill into Thai border villages, prompting Thai troops to fire warning shots after clashes damage homes and injuring locals. Thai police have arrested two Singaporeans and three Thais for a cross-border prostitution ring, while authorities have seized 2.74 million meth pills hidden in furniture and warned that violent threats from smugglers are part of border enforcement life. Malaysia and Thailand have adopted new cooperation records after border talks, and Thailand is assessing the relocation of a scam network to neighboring countries. Malaysians using illegal marriage syndicates in southern Thailand risk committing zina, and Cambodia has rejected Thailand's claim to the K’nar temple through heritage registration. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPOUJIeEFxaVAzMW9JR2FFYUtFWUdUSmE3Y1pQVUtwZi01UmJnZkh1N0h5NTZ5ak84ZGlVcjl6MG5Gbl92N1BPRWNSa2RiOUtpZmtZT2tvenFLQm50bVExQUJvVzdLbHc1aFB0WDBXYy0yZnQxUURqZThwY3BLR0lYSC1DTG5NTWNURkItekFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxOZFFCRG9ZY29LRk5qUFNqZE5MUDZqUno0aTNNMjk1MS0wcVFpbDRjcVBPb1c5UWFYYnFrMzBzZDA0OENrS1Nja3FUelpLeHFicHRETUNKSFBnb2VYV1NyVmtLeEVzQ1lsRDJLMExCVS0ybDNpLUU3cDNfTkVZckZyaUdtc1NiNFdqZVBKOXVtZTBTZzNQZHFKdFdzRWZTTjE5Tjh1QjhxNE5PTnRKZHBBNnk2ZWFCSm9vN2dKS0NFcGNLd0dlZi16dThR?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Malaysian Reserve&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE5LR3Y2bnNNRGRTb2MzanpEQ0RUblpfY3BQa0VDYWhJX0xGZG1IcjJOSU5qNjJRZzJ4SjVUdk42RkMwSlp6dUdaRTFuSWJzMHhxSVgwQlR2UWI5QnhRdVgxU3NtTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://